<title>USA: John Alden to sell Western Diversified.</title>
<headline>John Alden to sell Western Diversified.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Alden Financial Corp said Friday that it is selling its Western Diversified Group of companies to the Protective Life Insurance Co, the principal operating subsidiary of Protective Life Corp.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
